{"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"module","roleHeading":"Framework","externalID":"TrackingPlans","role":"collection","modules":[{"name":"TrackingPlans"}],"title":"TrackingPlans"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracking plan is the contract between an app and whoever reads its events: dashboards, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"warehouse, a collector, another platform’s client. Each event’s document gives its version,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"consent category, properties and their JSON types, which ones every payload holds, and which are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", in a form that needs no Swift to read. Committed beside the events, it puts every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"change to them in the pull request as a JSON diff. Its check says which changes break what has","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"already shipped: payloads from installed app versions that a validating collector would reject,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and stored records the app could no longer decode.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan"},{"type":"text","text":" turns events’ schemas into files: an index, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tracking-plan.json"},{"type":"text","text":", and for each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event a JSON Schema (draft 2020-12) document and an example payload. The files are values, so the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same schemas give the same bytes on every run and platform, ready to commit for the people and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tools outside the app."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Checking compares the plan the events make now with the committed one by what the files mean. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCheck"},{"type":"text","text":" is a match, a plan that is only out of date, or one with a breaking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"difference: a change that, at the same version, would leave a stored record or an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already-released app’s payload unable to decode or validate. Each "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanDifference"},{"type":"text","text":" names"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the event, the property and the change, and says whether it is breaking."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only code compiled against the app’s event types can read their schemas, so the app writes a small"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"executable of its own: a type that conforms to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", marked "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@main"},{"type":"text","text":". It writes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the plan to a directory, or checks it with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"check"},{"type":"text","text":". To run the check from the app’s tests instead,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TrackingPlanTesting"},{"type":"text","text":". The schemas usually come from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"type":"text","text":" (module "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EventMacros"},{"type":"text","text":"):"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/init()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" takes every "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"type":"text","text":" in the program and the library’s own events, found at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"run time, and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/init(schemas:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" takes a list."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The module is a product of its own that ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import Traffluent"},{"text":" leaves out.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import TrackingPlans","import Traffluent","","@Event(name: \"signed_up\")","struct SignedUp {","    var plan: String","}","","let plan = try TrackingPlan()  \/\/ every @Event in the program, and the library's own","let check = plan.check(against: plan.files)  \/\/ .matches","let paths = plan.files.map(\\.path)","\/\/ [\"tracking-plan.json\", ..., \"signed_up.v1.schema.json\", \"signed_up.v1.example.json\"]"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The plan also writes the schemas of an Iglu registry, which a Snowplow pipeline validates events","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"against (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/igluFiles(vendor:registry:carryingForward:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/writeIgluRegistry(to:vendor:registry:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"). Version N of an event is SchemaVer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"N-0-0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". For Iglu Server, a compatible change at the same version is the next addition, ","type":"text"},{"code":"N-0-1","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and on, superseding the earlier ones; a static repository doesn’t supersede, so there the export","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"refuses it, and so it does a breaking change for either kind: raise the event’s version.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The guide "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingplanworkflow","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"covers the executable, the command plugins and the test."}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackingplans"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"title":"Making a plan","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/File","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanError"],"anchor":"Making-a-plan"},{"title":"Writing a plan","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files(carryingForward:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/write(to:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand"],"anchor":"Writing-a-plan"},{"title":"Exporting an Iglu registry","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/igluFiles(vendor:registry:carryingForward:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/writeIgluRegistry(to:vendor:registry:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluRegistry","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluExportError"],"anchor":"Exporting-an-Iglu-registry"},{"title":"Checking a plan","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(against:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(againstDirectory:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCheck","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanDifference"],"anchor":"Checking-a-plan"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Export every event an app tracks as JSON Schema that people and services outside the app can read, and check each change against the plan committed before it."}],"references":{"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlan/files(carryingForward:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplan\/files(carryingforward:)","title":"files(carryingForward:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The plan’s files, as "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" lists them, with each event’s document keeping the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"properties its document in "},{"code":"committed","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", at the same name and version, has that the event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no longer declares: each with its schema there, marked "},{"code":"deprecated: true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The documents in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"committed","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" of an event’s earlier versions, below the newest the plan lists, are kept too,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with their examples, byte for byte, and listed in the index."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files(carryingForward:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"files","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"carryingForward","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV","text":"TrackingPlan","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV4FileV","text":"File","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]) -> [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV","text":"TrackingPlan","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV4FileV","text":"File","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlanCommand":{"title":"TrackingPlanCommand","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplancommand","abstract":[{"text":"An executable that writes a tracking plan: the type marked ","type":"text"},{"code":"@main","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in a target of the app’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"package that links the modules declaring its events.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TrackingPlanCommand","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TrackingPlanCommand","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand"},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlan":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplan","title":"TrackingPlan","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The JSON Schema (draft 2020-12) of every event an app tracks: one document per event and an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index, exported from the events’ "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventSchema"},{"type":"text","text":" values."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TrackingPlan"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TrackingPlan"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlan/writeIgluRegistry(to:vendor:registry:)":{"title":"writeIgluRegistry(to:vendor:registry:)","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplan\/writeigluregistry(to:vendor:registry:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Writes the plan’s events as the schemas of an Iglu registry of the kind "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"registry"},{"type":"text","text":" under"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vendor"},{"type":"text","text":" into "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"directory"},{"type":"text","text":", the registry’s root, creating the directories needed."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/writeIgluRegistry(to:vendor:registry:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"writeIgluRegistry"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"to"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials3URLV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"URL"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"vendor"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"registry"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans12IgluRegistryO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"IgluRegistry"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans15IgluExportErrorO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"I